# Raw benchmark outputs are not committed by default.
# Keep large/raw local artifacts out of Git; check in concise sanitized manifests
# (Markdown summaries and quervant-bench-v1 JSON) under benchmarks/reports/.
*
# Re-include subdirectories so the explicit markdown/JSON negations apply inside
# them (a directory excluded by '*' is otherwise never traversed).
!*/
!/.gitignore
!AGENTS.md
!README.md
!*.md
!*.json
